{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-15_beg","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"main_16-14","title":"曠野轟鳴","storyCode":"16-15","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_16-15_beg.txt","sourceHash":"8031bc3a3e0e5eb2e4b9c32b1125d8ffc9b8c1498ebc3f532b1a500335635502","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"第四集團軍派來使者，希望女大公能在他們前去剿滅“叛亂”時保持沉默。博士等人為了向同伴傳遞消息，使用了研究所中的緊急通訊設備。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g2_farnorthgovernment"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說來奇怪……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我很喜歡布列斯克的這個季節。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有太陽的東升西落，沒有晝夜分明……人們也不用假裝一切都很明瞭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“多事之秋”，元帥也是這麼說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女大公殿下，時間緊迫。即使是在我享用您招待的這一杯熱茶的時間裡，局勢也在不斷變得緊張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"元帥在等待您的答覆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"連葉甫根尼元帥都坐立難安了，看來烏薩斯真的面臨著巨大的麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您完全正確。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這樣的局勢下，聖駿堡溫吞的反應將不被接受——這不只是元帥一人的意見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時至今日，他應該早已理解，他的父親在當年那場動亂中的舉措堪稱睿智——第四集團軍本會有比發配邊疆更壞的結局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼如今，年輕的葉甫根尼，是下定決心要衝往眼下亂局的第一線嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"永遠站在離危險最近的地方保護烏薩斯——元帥在履行烏薩斯軍人的天職。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在的問題，在於您，女大公殿下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"元帥需要您還願意維繫往日的合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是他對我的通知？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是一個基於友誼的請求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"元帥他非常重視與您的友誼，同樣也信任您的智慧。他相信，即使在這個時候，布列斯克與第四集團軍的利益也是緊密相連的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何況他並不請求您做什麼額外的事——只要您的一個點頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來，他似乎認為這很容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道他將我們的皇帝陛下當成一個蠢材嗎？難道維特議長也是一個蠢材嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是非此即彼的選擇……就像太陽不會與黑夜共存。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"元帥非常理解您的處境，他當然願意為您分憂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何，一位“皇帝的利刃”的隕落，有非常充分的解釋空間，而元帥願意替您做出這個解釋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“第四集團軍協助布列斯克剿滅了發生在遠北地區的叛亂”——只要您願意合作，集團軍呈交給聖駿堡的報告上，就只會有這樣一句話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至不必點頭，您的沉默，元帥也可以接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……並非如此……如果元帥他真的理解我，就該知道我在意的從來不是來自聖駿堡的質疑……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生活在我的領地內的人民，烏薩斯的人民……我在意的只有他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"元帥理解您的仁慈，他向您保證，您劃下的線，沒有人可以逾越。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年輕的葉甫根尼，急躁的葉甫根尼……我又怎會願意看到我親愛的朋友以身涉險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕真的如他所願，我保持沉默，這也不過是在他前行的險路上抹去了一堆小小石頭，那些巨大的山石他又準備如何處置？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些，就不勞女大公殿下煩憂了。無論是山石還是其他東西，元帥他有決心為烏薩斯戰勝所有敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼……我是否可以理解為，已經得到了您的答覆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"葉甫根尼元帥向您問好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的烏薩斯軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了烏薩斯的榮光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一切為了烏薩斯的榮光……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g3_miningarea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科謝尼婭，你還好嗎？不行的話我也可以抱著你們兩人一起跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不用。我……還好……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是不懂……我們為什麼……要這麼急著趕路？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我有一個猜想……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"如果烏薩斯官方已經得知了礦脈的異變……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"能讓遠北所有的礦區都陷入沉寂，只有一種解釋——","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"烏薩斯不會讓礦脈枯竭的消息傳播出去。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你看天空的顏色！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們進來的時候，是這樣的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不……這是我的幻覺嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼又是……這樣的顏色？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g4_miningarea_polluted"},{"type":"narration","text":"醒目的、具有警示意涵的紅色，甚至不需要特意抬頭就能看到。\n它逐漸籠罩了原本灰濛濛的昏暗天幕，也覆蓋了地面的一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……軍隊。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"烏薩斯軍隊的警示燈。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他們已經來了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼軍隊會在這個時候深入遠北？他們根本不應該來到這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，西北方五公里處偵測到大規模的高能源石反應，有人在快速向我們靠近。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……馬上回到研究所。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"必須立刻告知阿米婭。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科謝尼婭，你還好嗎？我們該加速了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，研究所……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要回到研究所。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g9_institutecorridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這邊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得緊急通訊設備都放在頂樓的觀景台，鑰匙在所長辦公室——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）不是我們的腳步聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）這裡還有其他人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"聽起來人數不多。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"沒時間了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"要儘快通知阿米婭。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g10_instituteinterior"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，這裡沒有緊急照明燈，看不清楚。我已經點蠟燭了，先將就一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯……通訊設備在這裡。我沒用過這種東西，不確定它能傳遞訊號的距離有多遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是烏薩斯軍用通訊器。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你認識這種裝置？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian有類似的裝置——她年輕的時候曾參與過烏薩斯軍方類似設備的研究，沒想到他們竟然已經做出成果了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果和我知道的一樣，那這就是一種高性能全域訊息廣播裝置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它具有一個功率極高的施術單元——功率大概相當於同時使用一百台普通軍用級通訊器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它的設計初衷，就是為了能向大範圍內的軍用設施發送緊急電報。當然，擅長使用感知類源石技藝的人，比如Raidian，也能接收到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這難道不是好事？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你為什麼這麼緊張？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是它沒有辦法發送出特定頻段的訊號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，如果我們在這裡使用這個裝置發送了訊息，不遠處的烏薩斯軍隊也一定會接收到……我們的位置會立刻暴露。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……發送訊息。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"發送訊息，然後立刻轉移。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，聽你的，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把你要發出的訊息告訴我，我來操作。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"烏薩斯，礦脈正在全面枯竭。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已輸入，還有呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事？他們為什麼要襲擊研究所？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"至少有一支軍隊介入了遠北事務。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他們會封鎖消息——","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，輸入完成！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發送——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"立刻撤離！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士、科謝尼婭，抓緊我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在就——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂……喂——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"該死……真不知道算趕上了還是沒趕上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那個怪物，你抓我的時候不是還蠻厲害的嗎？千萬不要這麼輕易地就死在這裡啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"聽到我的聲音了嗎？能聽見嗎——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……博士？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
